71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MkYnTtJEyTcQ7kNvwGhbv54&_nc_oc=AdrFPWiIbRpSx_hgT7YuFviabzckcgKf5ivl5bNRDfWODbs2uobXRKfu4yixaNa9Lks&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP452uFi_3yQtF8pBSAUiBCkBtcQnThsh1Cko2_89W-dQ&oe=6ACE65F9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tivleoZbo0IQ7kNvwGKc1OK&_nc_oc=Adpasx0QEbANUPFPplCZeV_DvscHemwb0zAmZin-Fw8ufExIp-J5sFrc6R__hIey2YU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN8HMQWbe_wOJIJCDZ6E7dHdtP8WVjIH0SPSXgK_O9Ijg&oe=6ACE4093"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5mE-7_6nKYkQ7kNvwGm1I5i&_nc_oc=AdqbsW9_5_aBHx_ZmoeAtvNtI9Tn2s5FERBy7ga1VeKy7Dnsamp3DuUDk0Og5JSuC7A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPOb1ExBPZYr711PcSHcWPh_DLG9O-kDWuvIECUwb51iQ&oe=6ACE3EDA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: